  "cooldown_deferred_behavior": "Cooldown pulses are scoped to the daily reset. Durable challenge and per-category action state, including confirmed partial chest progress, survives restart. If the challenge is unavailable, continue to the Stage Overview without fabricating a result; an unknown consequential effect remains unresolved and is not retried identically.",
  "bounded_recovery_behavior": "Persist unknown challenge and chest effects independently across restart and deny the identical action retry. Continue only independently authorized green-ready categories when no unresolved consequential effect blocks them; return to canonical Home only after positive Home recognition.",
